{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾撰序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孫〈記〉云故\n參預蘇貳卿序之於前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾作詩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〈記〉云峽路運使．\n\n史館丁刑部作為冠篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "撰碑記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案：此二十餘池，乃是元末張氏移築城湖曲，廢隄堰隔之為池，"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玉壺、雲洞，在壇東。壇北皆\n傍池據勝者。僧不知古蹟，姑以是對"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見法師記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名大觀，慈受房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名通琳，勝蓮房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名德行，天香房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名承見，字聖義，又名承超，慈忍房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名覺行，東京房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名宗鏡，三生房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名深裕，東震房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師生時，有黑龍涌水之祥。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名真誰，古樸房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名善恒，東京房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名真乘，功德房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名範行，三生房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名界乘，勝蓮房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師名滿恒，勝蓮房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未考"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未考"}
